WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.328 --> 00:00:14.589
I hope they’re all right.

2
00:00:14.609 --> 00:00:16.870
Tina: Let’s try to crack the ice!

3
00:00:21.752 --> 00:00:22.852
This won’t work!

4
00:00:22.892 --> 00:00:25.713
Brad: We need to melt the ice!

5
00:00:26.634 --> 00:00:29.195
Tina: It’s too cold up here on the mountaintop.

6
00:00:29.695 --> 00:00:31.996
Brad: The sun is so gray.

7
00:00:33.032 --> 00:00:34.914
It’s not very bright or warm.

8
00:00:34.934 --> 00:00:36.695
Danny: The sun!

9
00:00:37.016 --> 00:00:38.377
We need to color the sun.

10
00:00:38.397 --> 00:00:42.020
Danny: Stand back, I’ve got a sun to make.

11
00:00:44.482 --> 00:00:46.904
Danny: You’re stronger than I am.

12
00:00:47.585 --> 00:00:48.365
You should throw it.

13
00:00:48.385 --> 00:00:51.848
Tina: But my imagination’s not as good as yours.

14
00:00:51.868 --> 00:00:53.810
Danny: That’s okay.

15
00:00:54.591 --> 00:00:56.152
We’ll all imagine together.

16
00:00:56.592 --> 00:00:57.213
Ready, Brad?

17
00:00:57.233 --> 00:00:59.014
Brad: I’m with you.

18
00:00:59.775 --> 00:01:00.556
Let’s do it!

19
00:01:05.872 --> 00:01:06.392
Danny: Ready?

20
00:01:06.412 --> 00:01:16.575
Tina: One, two, three Great throw, Tina.

21
00:01:16.595 --> 00:01:20.956
Brad: Did it make it?

22
00:01:20.976 --> 00:01:28.438
Danny: You did it!

23
00:01:28.458 --> 00:01:29.859
I knew you could!

24
00:01:29.879 --> 00:01:31.419
Tina: We did it!

25
00:01:32.160 --> 00:01:33.400
All of us together!

26
00:01:37.536 --> 00:01:39.297
Brad: Look what’s happening everywhere!

27
00:01:39.317 --> 00:01:40.758
Danny: We’ve done it!

28
00:01:41.378 --> 00:01:42.879
We’ve saved Ginormous!

29
00:01:45.841 --> 00:01:50.163
Tina: The ice is melting!

30
00:01:50.743 --> 00:01:53.265
Just another minute or two and they’ll be free.

31
00:01:53.285 --> 00:01:58.087
Tristay: Not so fast, you troublemakers!

32
00:01:58.107 --> 00:02:00.849
Danny: You’re too late, Tristay!

33
00:02:01.509 --> 00:02:02.970
The sun is up in the sky.

34
00:02:02.990 --> 00:02:06.092
Danny: All the color has returned to Ginormous.

35
00:02:07.072 --> 00:02:11.796
Tristay: You children think that you have won, but you couldn’t be more wrong!

36
00:02:11.816 --> 00:02:18.562
Brad: We restored the color to the ocean, to the grass [n3@and flowers, and now to the sky.

37
00:02:18.582 --> 00:02:22.545
Tristay: Yes, and that will be a great help to me.

38
00:02:22.565 --> 00:02:26.989
Danny: Our colors destroyed all your evil creatures!

39
00:02:27.009 --> 00:02:29.831
Tristay: Yes, you did defeat my helpers.

40
00:02:29.851 --> 00:02:33.874
Tristay: But there’s a big difference between me and them.

41
00:02:33.894 --> 00:02:35.616
Tina: What’s that?

42
00:02:36.364 --> 00:02:39.846
Tristay: Color harms them, but color makes me powerful!

43
00:02:39.866 --> 00:02:42.348
Tristay: You have been helping me all along.

44
00:02:42.368 --> 00:02:45.450
Danny: I don’t understand.

45
00:02:46.391 --> 00:02:48.452
You wanted us to restore the color?

46
00:02:48.472 --> 00:02:52.275
Tristay: I realized that I needed more power to defeat you.

47
00:02:52.295 --> 00:02:56.198
Tristay: So I decided to let you complete your mission.

48
00:02:56.218 --> 00:03:01.321
Tristay: Now that color has returned to Ginormous, I can absorb it again.

49
00:03:01.341 --> 00:03:04.844
Tristay: I will become the most powerful giant ever!

50
00:03:06.076 --> 00:03:09.839
Danny: We were helping Hopian and the colorless giants, not you!

51
00:03:09.859 --> 00:03:11.781
Tristay: But you weren’t.

52
00:03:12.882 --> 00:03:14.303
You were helping me.

53
00:03:14.323 --> 00:03:17.586
Danny: It’s not true!

54
00:03:17.606 --> 00:03:19.528
Tristay: You know it’s true, Danny.

55
00:03:19.548 --> 00:03:21.410
Tristay: Look into your heart.

56
00:03:22.270 --> 00:03:23.932
You’re a bad boy yourself.

57
00:03:25.733 --> 00:03:26.614
Danny: No, I am not!

58
00:03:26.634 --> 00:03:29.977
Tristay: You are always getting into trouble at school.

59
00:03:31.058 --> 00:03:32.980
Tina: Leave him alone, you big bully.

60
00:03:33.960 --> 00:03:36.441
Brad: Danny just has an active imagination.

61
00:03:36.461 --> 00:03:39.823
Tristay: You have an active imagination and a wicked heart.

62
00:03:39.843 --> 00:03:43.044
Tristay: Of course you’re a bad boy, Danny.

63
00:03:43.064 --> 00:03:49.307
Tristay: My powers are about to grow even stronger, and it’s all thanks to you!
